The Go implementation, SMTP delivery, durable SQLite workflow, operational
commands, tests, container and documentation were added by fxTunnel contributors
in 2026. API payloads and workflow concepts were adapted from app/nalog_api.py
and app/main.py. This fork changes the default runtime from Python to Go.
The original Python source and configuration examples are retained for reference;
see README.python.md, Dockerfile.python and docker-compose.python.yml.
